      "content": "That's a bit too high-level for what I'm doing. I'm not looking for a summary of political science debates. I need the actual ammunition. If I'm sitting in a room with donors, I can't just say \"it's mired in disagreement.\" I need to show how their math doesn't add up. \n\nGive me the specific, practical failures of their biggest policies—like their stance on wealth taxes or universal programs. How do those policies actually fail in the real world? I need the strongest arguments that show their platform is fundamentally unsustainable.",
